@startuml
<style>
timingDiagram {
  note {
    .n1 { BackGroundColor pink }
  }
}
</style>
concise "C" as C
robust "R" as R
@0
C is a
R is b
note top of C <<n1>> : styled
note bottom of R : plain **bold**
note top of R
  first
    indented
  third
end note
@10
C is d
note bottom of C <<n1>>
  long styled
end note
@enduml
